==Deployment==

For prototyping simplicity, the present code implements OP\_MERKLESUB as a hardfork. Indeed, 
non-upgraded nodes are not able to include the internal public key parity bit inside the tweak and
as such validate a Taproot commitment in compliance with upgraded ones. A softfork version of OP\_MERKLESUB
should be possible, where the internal parity bit is committed as one-more-tweak on top of the
Taproot commitment, transparent to non-upgraded nodes.
